ime Reverse Transcription-PCR Assay for the Detection of Human and Animal Noroviruses in Clinical and Environmental Samples</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>5464</fpage><lpage>5470</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17616614</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/AEM.00572-07</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scipioni</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bourgot</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Mauroy</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ziant</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Saegerman</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Daube</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Thiry</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detection and quantification of human and bovine noroviruses by a TaqMan RT-PCR assay with a control for inhibition</article-title><source>Mol Cell Probes</source><year>2008</year><comment>doi: 10.1016/j.mcp.2008.02.003</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18424068</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Atmar</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Neill</surname><given-names>FH</given-names></name><name><surname>Romalde</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>F</surname><given-names>LG</given-names></name><name><surname>Woodley</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Metcalf</surname><given-names>TG</given-names></name><name><surname>Estes</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Detection of Norwalk virus and hepatitis A virus in shellfish tissues with the PCR</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>1995</year><volume>61</volume><f